{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37275","headline":"送友人罢举授南陵令 · 秦韬玉","name":"送友人罢举授南陵令","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"共言愁是酌离杯，况值弦歌枉大才。\n献赋未爲龙化去，除书犹喜凤衔来。\n花明驿路燕脂暖，山入江亭罨画开。\n莫把新诗题别处，谢家临水有池台。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"秦韬玉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37275.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37275","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}